; FileCheck spec for const_arg_atomic.logos — T2-24 (B).
;
; The forwarder specialized for Ordering::Acquire (disc 1) lowers its atomic
; load with `acquire`, and the one for Ordering::Release (disc 2) lowers its
; store with `release` — proving the literal reached the intrinsic across the
; (non-inlined) wrapper boundary. The unspecialized bodies keep seq_cst.

; CHECK-LABEL: define {{.*}}i64 @{{(\")?[^"]*my_load[^"]*__cv_1_Ordering1(\")?}}
; CHECK: load atomic i64, ptr {{.*}} acquire

; CHECK-LABEL: define void @{{(\")?[^"]*my_store[^"]*__cv_2_Ordering2(\")?}}
; CHECK: store atomic i64 {{.*}} release
